<title>TURKEY: Turk shares up 1.2 pct ahead of censure vote.</title>
<headline>Turk shares up 1.2 pct ahead of censure vote.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Istanbul shares posted gains in weak volume on Tuesday ahead of a preliminary vote in parliament on a censure motion against the Islamist-led coaliton government, brokers said.</p>
<p>The IMKB National-100  .XU100 closed at 1,510, up 18 points, or 1.21 percent from Friday. The market was closed for a holiday on Monday. The index brushed a high of 1,518 in the afternoon.</p>
